@startuml
' State machine of room.status (Report 4, Figure 21). States show the label of the figure and the value stored in the code.
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description
state "Room available\n(AVAILABLE)" as AVAILABLE
state "Under maintenance\n(MAINTENANCE)" as MAINTENANCE
state "Room occupied\n(OCCUPIED)" as OCCUPIED
state "Room being cleaned\n(CLEANING)" as CLEANING
[*] --> AVAILABLE : Partner adds the room
AVAILABLE --> MAINTENANCE : [Put under maintenance]
MAINTENANCE --> AVAILABLE : [Maintenance finished]
AVAILABLE --> OCCUPIED : [Guest checks in]
OCCUPIED --> CLEANING : [Guest checks out]
CLEANING --> AVAILABLE : [Staff marks the\nroom cleaned]
CLEANING --> MAINTENANCE : [Put under maintenance]
MAINTENANCE -[dashed]-> [*] : [Partner removes\nthe room] (planned)
legend bottom
Dashed arrow: planned, not implemented yet.
endlegend
@enduml
